{"hw":"λυσιτελέω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">λυσιτελέω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">λυσιτελ-έω</span>, prop. <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">indemnify for expenses incurred</b>, or <b class=\"lex-tr\">pay what is due</b>, and then '<b class=\"lex-tr\">pay</b>', i.e. <b class=\"lex-tr\">profit, avail</b> (cf. <span class=\"gk\">λύω</span> <abbr>v.</abbr> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2</span> </span>), c. dat., </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">I</span> with subject expressed, <span class=\"gk\">οὔ φημ' ἂν λυσιτελεῖν σφῷν [τοῦτο</span>] <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Pl.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">509</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">λυσιτελεῖ ἡμῖν ἡ δικαιοσύνη</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Prt.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">327b</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">δοῦλος τοιοῦτος οἷος μηδενὶ δεσπότῃ λυσιτελεῖν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Mem.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.1.15</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> mostly impers., <span class=\"gk\">λυσιτελεῖ μοι</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">it profits</b> me, <b class=\"lex-tr\">is better</b> for me, c. <span class=\"lex-gram\">part.</span>, <span class=\"gk\">οἷς οὐδ' ἅπαξ ἐλυσιτέλησε πειθομένοις</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Lys.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">25.27</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">πολλοῖς δὴ ἐλυσιτέλησεν ἀδικήσασι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Alc.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.113d</span> </span>: c. <span class=\"lex-gram\">inf.</span>, <span class=\"gk\">λ. προϊέναι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Tht.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">181b</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τεθνάναι νομίσασα λυσιτελεῖν ἢ ζῆν</span> thinking it <b class=\"lex-tr\">better</b> to be dead than alive, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">And.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.125</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">R.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">407a</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Cyr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.4.12</span> </span> (v.l.), <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">PHamb.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">27.17</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">(iii B. C.)</span>, etc.: c. dat. pers., <b class=\"lex-tr\">it profits</b> one to do so and so, <span class=\"gk\">οὐ γάρ οἱ λυσιτελέειν.. δικάζειν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.97</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ὅτι μοι λυσιτελοῖ ὥσπερ ἔχω ἔχειν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ap.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">22e</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Hier.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7.13</span> </span>: sts. c. acc. pers., <b class=\"lex-tr\">it is good</b> that.., <span class=\"gk\">λυσιτελεῖ τὸν μέλλοντα κακῶς ἰητρεύεσθαι ἀμφότερα καταγῆναι τὰ σκέλεα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hp.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Fract.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">19</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">R.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">406d</span> </span>: abs., <span class=\"gk\">ἐλυσιτέλει γάρ</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Axionic.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.6</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">3</span> in bad sense, <b class=\"lex-tr\">conspire</b>, as gloss on ἐς τὸ κακὸν ἀλλήλοισι συντιμωρεῖ (<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hp.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Acut.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">17</span> </span>), <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Gal.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">15.494</span> </span> ( v.l. συντελεῖ ). </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> neut. <span class=\"lex-gram\">part.</span> as <span class=\"lex-gram\">Subst.</span>, <span class=\"gk\">τὸ λυσιτελοῦν</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">profit, gain, advantage</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.85</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">R.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">336d</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.28</span> </span>; a wrong etym. is given in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Cra.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">417c</span> </span>.</div></div>"}